’ki qito ki Wellington. Na kena ca, ni sa mani veivosakitaki oti tu me na vakatarogi ena retio yaloyalo ena vuku ni kena veitalanoataki na kacivaki ni yaca.\nOqo saraga nai tekitekivu ni dua na delana levu e sotava ena nona dauniveivakatavulici ena vuku ni kena sega ni rogoci na veika e laveta cake mai vei ira na tiko ena vale kau vulavula ena gauna oya.\nE vola nai vola, ena nona gauna taucoko ni qito e dau qarauna sara o Serevi me kakua ni vakayalolailaitaka e dua ena kena rogoci na nona itukutuku.","token_ids":[1702,64,13501,8564,264,294,637,13326,595,2210,4317,2477,64,600,348,2907,12782,2804,6357,11,4317,600,92899,337,28683,2804,78,600,15421,2015,35749,384,348,3843,14614,311,4554,595,2210,384,96010,4317,600,9760,85,35134,6586,13,506,6216,64,4317,2477,64,600,9624,5559,87549,80,6357,11380,143232,2907,4317,89616,265,662,64,15991,956,74237,402,585,277,2863,595,2210,274,53167,6089,12782,55628,1345,21050,662,64,348,5607,12177,2907,624,40,64,11,662,64,2477,64,3541,84,16720,19915,647,12297,11,384,10364,580,278,59706,297,328,485,9966,12782,2804,2143,16720,595,10519,16487,11239,283,4810,64,12782,293,2863,74237,277,1315,13326,296,2584,348,4284,11,4317,600,2329,278,14068,348,13326,3658,3658,72,11380,822,15711,13326,297,10246,9760,4317,6792,72,752,4317,1187,527,6642,2804,6357,19915,55628,13,12806,595,7157,2162,11,12782,822,147001,5208,24155,96582,14614,297,10246,9760,752,4317,74237,6392,63420,662,64,2112,815,379,278,2253,12523,662,64,348,35555,12782,595,7157,5208,2174,5652,459,6642,4317,595,580,344,14614,12782,379,17087,624,46,80,78,27951,12460,308,2143,41847,632,74,344,84,12782,96010,4317,1594,3362,22579,84,384,143232,2907,662,64,2477,64,2994,359,533,344,585,266,402,360,3375,662,64,348,35555,12782,595,7157,4810,64,12782,93365,2119,4317,5208,11491,384,29373,1915,19109,16720,5208,72,6216,64,4317,259,23565,662,64,33560,145977,11713,402,5607,662,64,13501,8564,297,7755,624,36,4400,64,308,2143,4400,64,11,662,64,2477,64,13501,8564,9446,1754,27154,12782,2804,6357,384,87549,2804,505