oya na agilose i Jiova, A cava ko sa yavita vakatolu kina na nomu asa? raica, ka'u a lako mai me'u tataro, ni sa lako vakatani na nomu i valavala vei au: 33a sa kunei au na asa, ka gole tani kina vakatolu vei au: kevaka sa sega ni gole tani vei au, ka'u sa vakamatei iko oti vakaidina, ka vakabulai koya, 34A sa kaya vua na agilose i Jiova ko Pelami, Au sai valavala ca; ka'u a sega ni kila ni kemuni a tu e na sala me tarovi au: ia oqo, kevaka sa ca vei kemuni, ka'u na lesu tale.","token_ids":[99869,32,822,274,485,4554,4317,342,63411,12782,438,64,15224,619,815,6586,11,16487,822,348,11977,595,2210,4317,438,64,5208,72,23597,10601,11,16487,595,12583,362,272,2907,16487,90836,822,272,585,2907,5208,72,600,9322,11,15224,822,379,402,12297,7906,74237,266,43556,595,2210,30,220,100104,32,822,595,12583,348,4284,4317,438,64,15224,23597,10601,11,21837,15224,822,74237,278,530,148026,7906,25,1962,96010,296,2584,308,2143,27230,36887,2863,384,326,16535,446,11,7906,822,2804,2143,74237,90307,72,600,9322,13,220,99064,32,822,595,12583,5208,72,23597,10601,4317,438,64,11,506,72,7906,4317,9658,84,438,64,511,4810,2143,11,16487,15224,822,87549,90251,37988,7906,384,4317,9658,84,293,5607,9446,1754,27154,16487,379,580,12654,4317,8365,64,297,80,78,26,7906,264,87549,8225,13326,387,4554,74237,3441,80,78,5208,72,600,9322,30,362,822,595,12583,15224,595,45784,11,468,4810,2143,13,220,100557,32,822,2804,2143,74237,309,6392,1315,14614,23597,10601,15224,619,815,6586,11,264,822,595,140948,15224,595,45784,11,12782,822,9760,384,4317,57537,4317,933,321,960,600,619,815,6586,11,264,822,259,21512,9760,384,28215,3362,4317,2477,2143,27230,36887,2863,25,264,822,6871,6586,74237,266,38311,292,84,13,220,101175,32,822,595,12583,348,4284,15224,595,45784,4317,933,321,960,600,619,815,6586,11,362,272,2907,15224,822,379,402,6255,74237,266,43556,595,2210,4317,9658,84,438,64,30,15110,3001,11,16487,90836,264,326,28683,16720,752,90836,259,6392,78,11,12782,822,326,28683,74237,266,5559,4317,9658,84,600,1044,402,6053,5208,72,7906,25,