a"," plante"," ni"," la"," raison"," de"," cette"," croissance","."," J","’ai"," pris"," des"," photos"," pour"," demander"," un"," avis",","," plutôt"," que"," d","’","appl","iquer"," la"," première"," recommand","ation"," trouv","ée"," au"," has","ard",".\n","J","’ai"," ajout","é"," aux"," photos"," une"," vue"," plus"," large",","," où"," l","’on"," voy","ait"," le"," passage"," et"," la"," place"," prise"," par"," la"," br","anche","."," En"," les"," regard","ant"," ensemble",","," j","’ai"," r","al","enti"," le"," geste"," qui"," m","’av","ait"," d","’","abord"," par","u"," évid","ent","."," Le"," jardin"," n","’ét","ait"," pas"," une"," page"," où"," chaque"," trait"," in","attend","u"," dev","ait"," être"," cor","rig","é"," auss","it","ôt","."," En"," attendant"," une"," réponse",","," j","’ai"," dég","ag","é"," le"," passage"," sans"," touch","er"," à"," la"," br","anche","."," Ce"," dé","lai"," m","’a"," permis"," de"," remar","quer"," le"," traj","et"," de"," la"," lumière"," à"," cet"," endroit","."," Pe","ut","-être"," fa","ud","ra","-t","-il"," ag","ir",","," peut","-être"," changer"," autre"," chose","."," J","’","aim","erais"," que"," mes"," notes"," conserv","ent"," la"," question"," init","iale"," et"," le"," conseil"," effect","ivement"," reçu",","," afin"," de"," ne"," pas"," ra","con","ter"," plus"," tard"," une"," décision"," h","és","it","ante"," comme"," une"," é","vidence"," que"," j","’","aur","ais"," toujours"," conn","ue","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"La branche avait poussé contre la grille pendant notre absence. Je pensais qu’il suffirait de la déplacer, mais je ne connaissais ni la plante ni la raison de cette croissance. J’ai pris des photos pour demander un avis, plutôt que d’appliquer la première recommandation trouvée au hasard.\nJ’ai ajouté aux photos une vue plus large, où l’on voyait le passage et la place prise par la branche. En les regardant ensemble, j’ai ralenti le geste qui m’avait d’abord paru évident. Le jardin n’était pas une page où chaque trait inattendu devait être corrigé aussitôt. En attendant une réponse, j’ai dégagé le passage sans toucher à la branche. Ce délai m’a permis de remarquer le trajet de la lumière à cet endroit. Peut-être faudra-t-il agir, peut-être changer autre chose. J’aimerais que mes notes conservent la question initiale et le conseil effectivement reçu, afin de ne pas raconter plus tard une décision hésitante comme une évidence que j’aurais toujours connue.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-fy-0082","collection":"dataset/fineweb/fy.jsonl","text":"Wa't oan Skotlân tinkt, sil al gau de kilt yn 't sin komme, de Skotske manljusrok, hoewol't dat eins mar ien diel fan 'e tradisjonele Skotske dracht is. De kilt is makke fan tartan, de ferneamde weve wollene stof yn rútsjepatroan, en oan it persize patroan ken in saakkundige daliks werom ta hokker clan oft de drager heart. De kilt wurdt fêstset mei de kiltspjelde (kilt pin), in sierspjelde mei in clansymboal (faak in bist of in plant) dy't ornaris droegen wurdt op 'e lege hoeke fan it bûtenste diel fan 'e kilt. By de kilt heart ek de sporran, de skieppewollene beurs, oan 'e boppekant mei sulver, groom of in oar metaal beslein, dy't oan 'e mulrym oan 'e foarkant fan it lichem oer de kilt hinne droegen wurdt.\nFierders bestiet de manljusdracht út knibbelhoazzen mei by ien skonk dêrby ynstutsen de sgian-dubh, de tradisjonele Heechlânske dagge. De úttearbere plaid, fan deselde tartanstof as de kilt, wurdt tradisjoneel skean oer it boppeliif oer ien skouder hinne droegen, en kin brûkt wurde as in soarte fan mantel of as in tekken om ûnder te sliepen.","token_ids":[97399,944,297,276,4818,354,75,39178,89835,83,11,5437,452,342,2863,409,595,2963,80107,364,83,7437,143438,11,409,4818,2412,440,883,52387,355,53204,11,11381,365,337,944,3258,88014,3594,600,268,1853,301,8404,364,68,4685,