true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Tréimhse chinniúnach ba ea í seo i saol an bhanna cheoil is mó cáil is éileamh riamh. Tugann an chéad deich nóimint nó mar sin achoimre ar a n-aistear go dtí sin; iad ag tosú amach sna déaga luatha, an cháil dhomhanda, ceol a chuir na ladhracha ag damhsa agus mná óga le báiní. Faoi 1969 bhí teannas le brath eatarthu, an fuinneamh ag tráth agus iad bailithe den Beatlemania. Bhí an banna ar a dhé deiridh.\nI mí Eanáir na bliana sin bhíodar bailithe le chéile le tabhairt faoi cheolchoirm a dhéanfaí a thaifeadadh. Bheadh orthu ceithre amhrán déag a chumadh is a chleachtadh don ócáid agus Lindsay-Hogg ann le gach rud a thaifeadadh. Get Back an teideal a bhí ar an tionscnamh ach is Let it Be a baisteadh ar an albam agus an clár teilifíse. Cuireadh clabhsúr ar an tionscnamh leis an gceolchoirm cháiliúil siúd ar bharr foirgnimh ar Saville Row; ba í an cheolchoirm dheiridh acu í mar bhanna.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-gl-0015","collection":"dataset/fineweb/gl.jsonl","text":"Solidariedade que chega de Cuba, que aporta persoal sanitario e docente, de institucións locais e asociacións doutros países e, por suposto, da Galiza, onde cómpre subliñar o labor que vén desenvolvendo a asociación Solidariedade Galega co Pobo Saharaui (Sogaps).\nMais, o problema do Sáhara occidental non é só un problema humanitario a resolver pola vía da caridade. Este conflito só pode ter unha solución política, que pase por respectar o seu dereito de autodeterminación, e aplicar os acordos acadados.\nXa cansa tanta hipocrisía de representantes institucionais e políticos, con declaracións, discursos ou chíos nas redes sociais, e ata intervencións moi grandilocuentes en foros como o Eucoco (Conferencia Europea de Apoio e Solidariedade co Pobo Saharaui), de cargos do PP e do PSOE, que nunca tiveron interese en resolver o problema cando lles tocou gobernar. E farta tamén vir escoitando a representantes da nova-vella política española con discursos solidarios, convertidos agora en chíos de resolucións da ONU e no máis absoluto silencio desde a posición de goberno.","token_ids":[45665,277,94368,1709,3016,6743,409,31544,11,1709,151246,76360,278,19774,3290,384,4629,6817,11,409,149926,82,1329,2782,384,68492,5721,82,91742,3630,70345,384,11,4154,1026,35611,11,2994,10615,17071,11,48692,28673,1307,265,1186,742,146381,297,9324,1709,348,10389,134870,8690,264,68492,5721,22083,277,94368,77604,6743,1062,393,38311,87249,1963,320,50,538,2625,4292,81715,11,297,40846,653,328,1953,71,5059,2983,61191,2477,3958,30964,650,40846,3738,133648,264,36037,1471,64,142217,2994,1803,9072,13,38468,82191,6357,30964,28097,1982,650,4223,139545,61057,11,1709,145279,4154,5091,277,297,19970,25199,6357,409,3078,347,16468,5721,11,384,144983,2643,138761,436,10401,5553,624,55,64,42388,64,148118,18115,4215,285,7431,409,144887,7759,42036,2782,384,138699,11,390,89905,82,11,2560,47621,5908,134822,436,17122,45800,142213,11,384,72905,150436,82,39772,6662,25872,68238,662,369,436,7952,297,468,1754,13132,320,1109,802,8791,144391,409,5232,78,815,384,22083,277,94368,1062,393,38311,87249,1963,701,409,61230,436,653,29734,384,653,11400,52515,11,1709,52395,149614,263,946,2367,662,36037,297,40846,272,4883,326,642,311,22192,728,652,51317,13,468,282,24893,25398,10389,8865,1531,1015,139614,264,144887,2994,40312,8272,6842,61057,144733,390,2560,47621,6437,10095,11,5508,13340,65303,662,134822,436,409,149163,82,2994,506,3926,384,902,28627,285,86835,1535,5437,954,815,22657,264,89486,409,728,652,2152,13],"tokens":["Solid","ar","iedade","Ġque","Ġche","ga","Ġde","ĠCuba",",","Ġque","Ġaporta","Ġperso","al","Ġsanit","ario","Ġe","Ġdoc","ente",",","Ġde","ĠinstituciÃ³n","s","Ġloc","ais","Ġe","Ġasoci","aciÃ³n","s","Ġdout","ros","ĠpaÃŃses","Ġe",",","Ġpor","Ġsup","osto",",","Ġda","ĠGal","iza",",","Ġonde","ĠcÃ³","mp","re","Ġsub","li","Ã±ar","Ġo","Ġlabor","Ġque","Ġv","Ã©n","Ġdesenvolv",