ʻike mua, hiki ke hele a paʻakikī. ʻO ka hoʻonohonoho ʻana i nā hana, nā lālā o ka hui, nā mea kōkua o waho a me nā mea kūʻai aku i kahi ala seamless kahi pilikia maoli.\nAkā ʻaʻole ʻo ka hoʻohui ʻana i ka poʻe ka hopena o ka moʻolelo. I mea e alakaʻi ai i kahi papahana me kahi kahe kūpono, pono ʻoe i kahi ala intuitive no ka kaʻana like ʻana i nā manaʻo hou, ka laulima ʻana ma o ka workflow, ka hōʻike ʻana, a me nā mea hou aku.\nLawe kēia iā mākou i ka hopena ʻaʻole maʻalahi ka hana ʻana i ke kaulike ma ka papahana no nā alakaʻi. Inā ʻoe e holo nei i kahi ʻoihana kūʻai aku, alakaʻi i kahi hui o nā hoʻolālā a i ʻole nā mea hoʻomohala, a i ʻole inā ʻike wale ʻoe i kahi hoʻomaka me kekahi mau hoaaloha - inā ʻaʻole ʻoe e hoʻohana ana i kahi mea hana hoʻokele papahana, he kuhi hewa nui paha ia.","token_ids":[134,119,32,134,119,1263,305,7570,600,16487,289,30537,384,305,7570,16720,40069,1962,11381,134,119,14215,134,119,3921,134,119,72,600,595,77357,685,16487,21391,624,47,10143,296,30537,133006,9838,223,79,2863,384,11381,134,119,141517,2267,4284,752,595,30537,296,30537,133006,10849,7157,264,305,30537,134,119,40651,600,16487,752,64,7491,11491,134,119,72,384,305,3362,281,52606,600,308,30537,595,545,13,220,134,119,46,148026,308,30537,25220,1466,3362,384,308,30537,77,30537,7491,134,119,29284,72,600,16487,220,134,119,2970,131729,11,305,7570,1962,53733,264,7106,134,119,585,1579,60187,13,220,134,119,46,16487,11381,134,119,263,97758,94487,220,134,119,3362,600,308,30537,305,3362,11,308,30537,326,30537,75,30537,297,16487,305,1963,11,308,30537,752,64,595,55287,74,4284,297,289,28482,264,752,308,30537,752,64,595,52606,134,119,2143,85483,600,595,50771,130328,46582,595,50771,11454,1579,685,7491,14215,624,55428,30537,220,134,119,64,134,119,1263,220,134,119,78,16487,11381,134,119,2267,1963,220,134,119,3362,600,16487,3193,134,119,68,16487,305,2508,64,297,16487,4544,134,119,1263,385,13,358,752,64,384,452,13326,134,119,72,16377,600,595,50771,25220,1466,3362,752,595,50771,16487,383,595,52606,6