lse,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Etaj sa a konsiste de kalkè trè difisil ak relativman douser argile, siltstone, grè ak marke. Antre nan kanal la nan Lanmè Nwa a konsiste de ti ti ponyen tè. Si se chanèl sa a defouye, li se inevitab ke:\na) Apeprè 1-1,5 milya materyèl m3 ap defouye. Excavation nan materyèl sa a pral pran ane, machin ègzumasyon ak eksplozif yo pral itilize, se konsa yo pral fon an ak ekosistèm li yo, fon ak Flora ap lajman detwi.\nb) Li pa posib mete yon materyèl nan gwosè sa a nenpòt kote. Pwobableman, ilo yo pral fòme nan Marmara. Lè ou konsidere sistèm fay aktif nan Marmara, travay sa a pral trè danjere.\nc) Pandan ègzumasyon an nan kanal la, pral gen twòp glissement, glisman teren ak efondre depann sou pwopriyete yo tè.\nd) Lè yo defouye nivo lanmè a, kanal la pral opere kòm yon sistèm drenaj, detwi rezèvwa yo anba tè dlo alantou kanal la ak sa ki lakòz salinizasyon nan rejyon an.\ne) Rejyon ki genyen ant kanal la ak Bosphorus la ap vin yon zile, se konsa tout sistèm transpò yo pral chanje ak difisil.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ht-0041","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ht.jsonl","text":"Nan konstriksyon sezon fredi, tiyo a pa pral krak akòz bon rezistans enpak nan materyèl la.\n3, bon rezistans estrès fann: HDPE gen sansiblite ki ba dan, fòs taye segondè ak rezistans grafouyen ekselan, anviwònman estrès fann rezistans tou trè eksepsyonèl.\n4, bon rezistans korozyon chimik: tiyo HDPE ka kenbe tèt ak korozyon yon varyete de medya chimik, prezans pwodwi chimik nan tè a pa pral lakòz okenn degradasyon nan tiyo a. Polietilèn se yon izolan elektrik, kidonk li pap pouri, rouye oswa korozyon elektwochimik; Li tou pa ankouraje kwasans lan nan alg, bakteri oswa fongis.\n5, rezistans aje, lavi sèvis long: tiyo PE ki gen 2-2.5% distribisyon inifòm nan nwa kabòn ka estoke deyò oswa itilize pou 50 ane, yo pa pral domaje nan radyasyon iltravyolèt.\n6, mete rezistans: rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE ak tès konparezon tiyo asye montre ke rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE se 4 fwa sa yo ki an tiyo asye. Nan transpò labou, HDPE tiyo ofri pi bon rezistans mete konpare ak tiyo asye, ki vle di pi long lavi sèvis ak pi bon ekonomi.","token_ids":[45,276,16524,29756,2787,24914,138330,282,64132,11,8985,16019,264,7106,548,278,23040,585,17303,22135,89,7814,47756,380,596,662,70455,19982,5517,722,4458,75,1187,624,18,11,7814,47756,380,596,29396,12136,282,1020,25,12163,1740,4081,15498,579,67583,19915,12783,9098,11,282,22135,82,259,59539,4810,2111,4458,17303,47756,380,596,57902,283,75544,88920,75494,11,458,9966,86,128595,1515,29396,12136,282,1020,47756,380,596,14766,489,4458,26771,325,1690,24914,4458,75,624,19,11,7814,47756,380,596,595,18278,4246,263,36801,1579,25,8985,16019,12163,1740,16487,48916,1371,259,4458,83,17303,595,18278,4246,263,379,263,13281,7714,409,1774,7755,36801,1579,11,79300,596,26496,347,16615,36801,1579,19982,259,4458,264,7106,548,278,92899,22135,89,5394,2667,409,6759,136632,19982,8985,16019,264,13,3651,3891,321,135820,511,379,263,22082,37576,134387,1579,11,10364,263,74,898,25220,4914,72,11,28266,9008,297,2280,64,595,18278,4246,263,10505,5840,142984,318,1579,26,14501,14766,7106,69947,413,11053,595,16109,596,30571,19982,17323,11,36020,129436,297,2280,64,282,644,285,624,20,11,47756,380,596,264,3756,11,326,6190,274,4458,2682,1293,25,8985,16019,21752,19915,4081,220,17,12,17,13,20,4,2846,285,24914,304,333,22135,76,19982,308,9986,73421,128595,16487,1788,4740,409,88,22135,297,2280,64,432,321,551,16818,220,99200,458,68,11,29385,7106,548,278,4719,11053,19982,435,7604,136632,3815,376,5663,337,4458,83,624,21,11,2270,68,47756,380,596,25,47756,380,596,19982,2270,68,19982,8985,16019,12163,1740,17303,259,12136,16524,3380,51279,8985,16019,438,9008,144757,1962,47756,380,596,19982,2270,68,19982,8985,16019,12163,1740,511,220,19,282,9986,822,29385,19915,458,8985,16019,438,9008,13,31998,1356,79,22135,10067,283,11,12163,1740,8985,16019,315,461,8935,78