意が向いた。同じ言葉でも、立ち止まる場所は違うらしい。\n短い文章では、書かなかった部分まで正確に伝えようとしなくてもよいのかもしれない。説明を戻す前に、残った言葉がどんな間隔で並んでいるのかを、もう一度声に出して確かめることにした。三行を読み終えてから次の話を始めるまでの、短い沈黙も気に入っている。","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-jv-0039","collection":"dataset/fineweb/jv.jsonl","text":"“Dene sing oleh dipasangi ana ing 16 titik kanggo spandhuk lan 12 titik kanggo baliho,” jlentrehe Eddy.\nPanggonan-panggonan sing diolehake, antara liya, Jalan Jemur Andayani, Jalan Dharmawangsa lan Jalan Kedungdoro. Panggonan kasebut ditemtokake klawan tetimbangan ora klebu wewengkon penataan lan isih ana ruwang kang cukup kanggo wong mlaku. Saliyane titik-titik pemasangan, KPU ngatur ukuran gedhene APK. Kanggo spandhuk yaiku, 1,5 x 7 meter lan kanggo baliho 4 x 7 meter. KPU nyepakake 600 atribut kampanye, sawatara sisane dicepakake dhewe dening parpol lan caleg. Paling akeh 20 ewu APK.\nSakehing panggonan kasebut wis disarujuki bebarengan antarane KPU lan Bawaslu sarta bakal diumumake marang parpol lan para caleg. (Bsh)","token_ids":[2073,35,1952,7780,50978,23539,300,77700,40069,6749,220,99317,8141,1579,97456,3346,978,437,71,3101,30571,220,98886,8141,1579,97456,3346,293,7955,6161,2419,84014,39681,383,468,53153,624,47,524,11664,276,2268,524,11664,276,7780,64006,73216,726,11,3196,5059,898,7755,11,619,32139,619,336,324,1597,352,5559,11,619,32139,42981,2178,672,524,9078,30571,619,32139,730,291,2185,67,18278,13,98294,11664,276,595,519,8087,294,1203,29482,726,595,19877,276,27758,20782,18600,58914,24216,19607,289,365,826,39322,5750,459,276,30571,374,6996,40069,11117,70025,97456,91964,454,97456,3346,289,644,15727,23492,13,328,7955,88,2145,8141,1579,2385,132226,281,33997,18600,11,730,6325,7777,2628,14660,25933,51850,71,1952,62046,13,53914,3346,978,437,71,3101,13517,38038,11,220,16,11,20,856,220,22,22901,30571,97456,3346,293,7955,6161,220,19,856,220,22,22901,13,730,6325,18969,747,585,726,220,103306,51671,332,33499,1981,68,11,5485,266,5059,51972,2145,22065,70455,726,33931,869