, yewwi-d ad as-yefk ittewlen n tussna tamaynut : \"Arkad, Ameẓẓul, akked talɣa tamatut- ɣaf waya i d-yefka tanakta « Tutlayt », akken daɣen i yessemgared gar-as akked « Tameslayt » akked « Asiwel ».\nAkken ad yezrew tutlayt i yellan d tamatut i yellan d tamadwant, yewwi-d ad as-yefk talɣa turkidt imi akken i neẓra tameslayt tettbeddil seg tallit ɣer tayeḍ deg umkan ɣer wayeḍ, deg umdan ɣer wayeḍ (ayen ara nwali deg temsirin-nniḍen) ; ɣef waya, yefka-d tarrayt i umi isema « Tayenkudt »(Synchronique) akken ad tt-yessemgired ɣef tarrayt « Tazgerkudt » (diachronique) i yellan tettwasemras deg tezrawin neɣ fell-as i yuddsent tezrawin send tasnilest. Tazrawt tayenkudt d tin yellan d turkidt deg wakud, s waya yewweḍ yefka-as yiwen wudem gar wid n tussna tamaynut.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-kab-0009","collection":"dataset/fineweb/kab.jsonl","text":"Tiddukla\ntadelsant “Asirem” ad teddes “Arraz n tsekla tamazight”, taddart\ntiwriwin n Tudja (Bgayet, Dzayer)\n1-Arraz\nn tsekla tamazight d arraz ara ad\nippwahegayen yal aseggas s ghur tiddukla\ntadelsant “asirem” n tiwririn tudja deg wseggas 2003.\n2-Arraz\na ad yili d annar i wsekfel n\ntsekla tamazight, d afu d asebghes i\nwiv yettnavin\nghef iééuran n yidles amazigh\niwakken ad yefrari gar idelsan nnidven.\n3-Arraz\nn tsekla tamazight ad\nyettunefk i wrraten ara ad\nyefriren deg tira n:\na-Ungalen\nb-Amuven\nn tullizin\nc-Aamuven\nn tmedyazt d yinzan tsuqal\nd-tmezgunin(ticqufin\numezgun.\n4-Yal\nwin yettdeyizen, yettarun ungalen, tullizin, ticqufin umezgun, tisuqal,\nnegh yeskefl d inzan d wansayen n leqbayel izmer ad yazen ghef sin imedyaten\n(02) seg warraten-is ttwarun\nakken iwatta, uqbel ass31/01/2003","token_ids":[51,307,56190,4260,198,127526,2010,517,1036,2121,554,76,854,993,40992,5799,1036,8837,1370,308,259,55888,4260,25398,1370,491,9333,259,718,471,198,10246,86,461,7526,308,89407,5580,320,48530,352,295,11,422,89,1135,340,16,6691,634,1370,198,77,