utājumiem triāla pasaulē joprojām ir NON STOP. Analizējot aizgājušo sezonu, jāsaka, ka Eiropas čempionātam, pretēji Pasaules, problēmu bija mazāk un mūsu organizatori veiksmīgi tika ar visu galā. Negatīvās tendences ir skaidras, tiesnešu atšķirīgais vērtējums katrā posmā, garie posmi ar palielinātu tiesnešu skaitu un palielinātām izmaksām utt.","token_ids":[144214,78,274,77357,8578,24230,77357,5580,650,9921,85,62725,36239,2143,274,77357,67,77357,281,30537,57629,30537,85,77357,5580,434,1791,38293,2406,30537,4260,10885,285,3172,300,775,346,10556,285,650,425,4835,16756,1726,89,6880,37876,8668,4598,1561,74,285,13,444,52606,5857,318,37876,131019,4598,1561,6642,9838,104,6321,10885,306,77357,83,537,38038,11639,78,274,77357,8578,624,50,77357,450,22365,64,9838,120,87561,16524,495,37471,60187,6586,650,147836,30537,259,11491,4349,152964,336,10246,393,15416,2425,2406,30537,4260,1619,60187,267,60187,50078,9838,120,87561,142906,60187,8211,326,77357,76,24266,13,444,13022,30537,74,30537,2994,152957,64,902,128309,6216,142906,60187,8211,796,60187,9921,85,3172,300,650,20538,3172,300,2406,30537,4260,1619,60187,267,60187,50078,13,47525,75877,152964,300,5185,1579,372,436,259,67398,600,1225,152957,2717,300,796,60187,9921,85,3172,300,308,337,1579,372,436,624,35368,724,902,274,30537,5368,11639,30537,74,1630,26776,502,2717,30537,73,24266,336,2406,30537,4260,6368,4943,77357,502,45651,73,30537,76,6216,20532,45268,13,19415,449,77357,73,354,264,449,70,30537,8612,11639,78,138330,84,11,502,30537,82,13326,11,16487,146721,887,300,32649,3262,290,30537,72147,11,4410,77357,7754,393,15416,2425,11,50653,77357,15116,22365,64,296,1370,30537,74,650,296,52606,26963,24230,50305,5208,1579,3563,60187,8211,259,11491,796,133579,15357,30537,13,23927,266,60187,85,30537,82,8375,2380,6216,1901,3779,12778,11,19780,811,11639,84,518,11639,152952,404,60187,70,2782,348,77357,3342,77357,73,6237,44000,81,30537,1133,76,30537,11,7364,645,1133,8154,796,281,7955,32578,30537,24420,19780,811,11639,84,1901,1315,84,650,281,7955,325