o te kai e kii ana i te wa o te hotaka, kaore koe e akohia me pehea te hoko taonga, te hanga, me te whakarite i nga kai totika pai. Ma te punaha tuku kai e mahi katoa maau.\nMe whakamatau au i te Nutrisystem Diet?\nMena kei te hiahia koe ki te whakaheke i te taumaha, kaore koe e aro ki te kai kai takai me te kai whakatotoka, ana kaore he nui o te waa ki te tunu kai me te whakareri i a koe ake kai, katahi ka hiahia pea koe ki te tirotiro i tenei huarahi poto.\nMena he pai ki a koe te kai i nga whenua maha, kaare e taea te whai i te Nutrisystem.\nE hia nga utu mo te Nutrisystem me pehea te mahi?\nKo te kaupapa $ 300 mo te marama o te kai.","token_ids":[82281,451,12158,78,2655,23228,372,13537,358,2655,50278,18343,5963,612,5267,6639,308,7471,64,96840,11,41620,13,1260,595,2143,2401,30645,1013,264,3101,9304,600,1013,595,2143,11,4317,16487,7777,17146,1013,9446,372,13537,297,264,15110,459,84,42970,485,595,2143,1013,308,7471,64,297,92365,595,2143,9760,332,20869,146171,566,60177,19915,1013,595,2143,2401,11491,624,147333,1013,289,2328,16487,259,5918,16720,600,296,6070,600,1013,7106,1915,68,297,311,9446,372,13537,420,5305,287,64,16487,305,19274,685,595,4644,19915,1013,305,37988,19915,1013,595,2143,600,289,28482,11,1013,420,585,277,632,600,297,595,2143,11,19915,1013,595,2143,595,2143,9760,332,20869,435,2145,72,13,29208,92365,595,1315,3902,383,297,1013,595,2143,384,595,3808,40069,600,1013,10445,297,1013,4017,13326,11,16487,460,595,4644,384,17303,2267,685,752,1051,39716,1013,305,27154,9446,93134,11,1013,14668,64,11,752,1013,420,585,277,632,600,92365,595,2143,2401,11491,60177,13,11326,1013,8309,13537,259,35555,595,2143,384,42970,72,595,4330,64,7491,2863,624,7823,420,585,309,459,84,7906,600,1013,18343,5963,612,26131,5267,44,7157,1962,72,1013,305,19274,685,595,4644,19915,1013,420,13326,383,440,600,1013,9446,372,13537,11,16487,460,595,4644,384,264,299,19915,1013,595,2143,595,2143,18088,2143,752,1013,595,2143,420,585,266,354,30645,11,40069,16487,460,566,308,1963,297,1013,289,5305,19915