da mereka yang rapat dan arif. Banyakkan bersembang dengan orang tua kita sebab diorang selalunya akan bagi banyak nasihat berguna. Bercakap-cakap juga dengan doktor dan midwife kalau ada concern. Diorang boleh bantu kuatkan semangat kita juga.\n11. Emergency Plan – Kita merancang, berdoa dan bertawakal tapi kita tak dapat elak daripada ketentuan Yang Maha Esa andai ditakdirkan terjadinya sesuatu yang kita tak jangka. Memandangkan saya dan suami dah ada pengalaman sedih sebelum tu, kami dah bincang kalau berlaku sesuatu, siapa yang boleh dihubungi etc. Kalau boleh buat persediaan juga daripada segi kewangan dan inform individu tertentu sekiranya perlu supaya diorang tau apa perlu buat kalau kita dilanda musibah.","token_ids":[98668,13,32233,266,8655,37599,11558,5748,30603,422,18233,3303,32139,40757,5559,1365,730,291,4284,96389,64,18635,84,9098,18864,1466,61458,8655,1079,32139,926,86091,9098,11800,278,360,1466,10202,2982,64,5234,14025,27280,26102,73706,4335,39991,58151,34933,9098,10202,79,517,524,13,96977,24760,1079,32139,32073,32139,70159,19692,437,2185,9098,8209,326,45560,42127,2048,266,82736,266,11,2048,266,23228,392,266,9098,511,21202,466,7755,624,86295,2863,34066,33539,285,2863,276,11,24667,73706,76188,63040,10366,7327,266,9098,796,333,13,425,49979,8655,10202,4838,524,20372,49289,63427,53849,511,47427,1853,83474,11800,278,80610,32518,84944,61458,17122,80221,45613,8564,13,425,2962,585,391,1786,585,391,42127,20372,40831,10975,9098,5099,47446,35179,2863,34066,4643,13,422,2462,524,708,73216,293,90544,36412,266,8655,5234,524,266,53849,42127,624,98965,13,31475,9676,1365,730,6255,4704,1129,524,11,10202,2982,64,9098,66610,672,585,278,97248,53849,18088,43862,655,585,15257,573,2584,31150,306,10381,24400,386,13537,468,9078,323,2143,21256,585,3741,8655,1982,61651,60659,15525,84,35134,10366,53849,18088,502,524,4554,13,13541,437,85303,53578,9098,913,10601,52144,34066,36495,278,12709,10918,6996,511,77616,9760,11,62228,52144,293,2840,524,35179,2863,10202,75,23492,15525,84,35134