na, potipatsa mwayi wambiri wamabizinesi. Tikufuna kuthokoza wokonzekereratu potithandizira kuti titenge nawo mbali muchionetso kukhala chopambana.\nZambiri Zazaka zana zapitazo-Chifukwa cha OPI chiwonetsero chathu tidatha kupereka zithandizo zathu zambiri zakomwe kuli anthu ambiri ogulitsa katundu ku China. Pakadali pano, tinachititsanso msonkhano wopambana wa atolankhani ndipo timakhala okhutira kwambiri ndi kutsatsa komwe kwachitika kudzera mwambowu.\nLJ Hooker-Tachita nawo gawo la Overseas Property Immigration Investment Fair kwa zaka 3 zapitazi. Ichi ndiye chiwonetsero chabwino kwambiri chomwe tidachitapo nawo gawo ku China. Poyerekeza ndi zochitika zina zomwe tapitako, mtundu wa makasitomala okhala ndi zolinga zamphamvu zikuwoneka bwino pano. Ndife ofunitsitsa kufikira mgwirizano wamtundu wanthawi yayitali ndi okonza mu 2018.\n","token_ids":[77139,1241,84,289,587,84,53449,316,485,15893,9986,15569,72,7350,360,1199,64,44000,1241,84,8871,20636,85483,5616,11,3338,573,1862,64,296,3117,72,289,2969,20636,289,309,370,449,1543,72,13,72182,1704,8564,595,940,27154,4360,289,562,26957,50879,261,35134,3338,410,437,449,8831,30479,72,8141,6309,75312,78,10011,7955,1753,290,295,704,92494,71,6053,46704,2969,3362,624,57,2969,20636,1863,1370,13326,1147,3362,32821,275,39963,29441,333,3101,9986,13508,506,1893,25718,54301,295,799,78,521,587,84,13104,65247,80054,485,4554,1147,410,437,42649,1147,587,84,1147,2969,20636,49991,316,896,595,23537,22211,84,8871,20636,7350,360,1199,64,44000,1241,84,36412,5616,13,13349,329,7955,281,5652,11,24714,610,275,1199,596,78,296,930,30544,5652,289,453,2969,3362,10445,87922,1180,86091,15569,6943,6792,21706,6053,5394,71,332,8831,29413,2969,20636,15569,72,595,6128,1862,64,10885,896,29413,610,275,11491,595,661,89,2416,52461,2969,363,84,624,43,41,28074,261,9282,610,6255,75312,78,342,672,78,1187,84601,300,8654,39467,32106,14578,595,9986,1147,13326,220,18,32821,275,17786,13,358,14594,15569,72,9008,25718,54301,295,799,78,521,370,86,3313,29413,2969,20636,521,316