angun hubungan mangrupikeun sabab anu pantes. Sedengkeun kuring panginten henteu teras-terasan nampi réspon, sababaraha kali nambahan nilai pikeun paguneman akhirna meunang perhatian ti pangarang. Kalayan kecap séjén, aranjeunna terang saha kuring.\n- I hindarkeun nyebarkeun URL dina koméntar anu kuring pasang. Kaseueuran bungkus koméntar numbu nami anjeun deui kana situs anjeun, blog anjeun, atanapi profil anu aya kakait kana situs anjeun. Koméntar spammer ampir-ampiran nyorong tautan dina konténna. Kuring biasana ngalaporkeun aranjeunna salaku spammers (kana Akismet), daptar hideung aranjeunna (on Disqus) sareng mupus koméntar spammy.","token_ids":[43,12910,1940,97248,600,20088,595,372,13537,5275,72,296,1310,276,595,1677,10545,6996,510,12,451,278,11491,595,1677,305,6817,84,58163,8612,57450,2068,7777,351,329,69365,14751,458,84,20149,287,281,2970,359,308,2969,56506,14764,359,15964,11,595,1677,4274,672,300,3376,296,1310,276,595,3362,60509,17113,96063,277,524,1982,355,27998,132212,75370,1728,8985,502,3249,276,60451,530,595,1677,1853,21256,84,281,2970,359,18969,26747,276,7777,277,64021,524,14764,359,15964,624,12,730,1677,82781,379,41989,379,10389,296,1310,276,595,3362,2444,355,458,84,595,1677,3873,963,7777,672,524,359,18686,50851,49874,30502,2970,359,19371,370,458,84,281,15465,13,35103,826,440,359,595,1677,96063,131989,305,6817,84,1982,300,12,465,45119,308,1121,72,30587,618,11,19371,93763,13537,95561,308,2969,21996,82677,281,2970,359,14764,359,15964,17303,29516,3376,752,359,524,817,9195,1103,8985,96063,277,524,13,26746,43606,1962,11341,18711,73,10389,11,796,84260,359,3376,1982,524,822,4223,595,1677,624,12,358,47028,277,440,359,78038,2257,440,359,5548,151327,10885,133483,277,458,84,595,1677,6368,524,13,730,519,361,25933,293,2185,77838,10885,133483,277,1629,19607,308,10601,458,3756,359,409,1963,595,3362,2444,355,458,3756,359,11,5010,458,3756,359,11,57450,2068,52010,458,84,264,7755,94598,1315,595,3362,2444,355,458,3756,359,13,26606,133483,277,25250,1174,1079,5565,12,1121,