i no te auraro ia ’na ma te taiva ore? E mana‘o anei oe e ua riro teie tupuraa ei taime no te haafatata ’tu ia Iehova?\n15. No te aha Adamu i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova?\n15 E faaau ana‘e te reira i ta te taata matamua ra o Adamu i rave. Ua tiaturi anei oia e e nehenehe oia e faaroo ore ia Iehova e e ora noa? Aita, “e ere hoi Adamu tei vare.” (Tim. 1, 2:14) No te aha ïa oia i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova? Ua amu Adamu i te maa hotu ta ta ’na vahine i horoa ’tu no te mea ua here rahi a‘e oia i ta ’na vahine i ia Iehova.","token_ids":[99367,13,468,4317,93423,358,2636,12654,384,259,2717,20869,16377,34651,67886,34651,8985,36049,12534,685,11381,5498,10576,78,297,1013,8620,84,2577,546,5267,99367,362,18198,6070,4317,600,1013,259,50771,132660,56998,88754,11123,72,13,393,1952,685,14000,68,45290,8985,36049,12534,685,11381,5498,10576,78,297,311,67886,8620,84,2577,546,13,547,64,432,68,67886,384,13537,9446,1013,29335,24010,384,1346,2863,15110,902,308,685,600,1013,1152,685,1013,72,8985,36049,12534,685,13,320,42,269,13,220,16,11,220,20,25,98965,26,358,19496,13,220,17,11,220,98668,8,2308,311,67886,1588,600,1982,64,9446,459,11,384,30014,14000,78,281,13537,67886,384,752,64,11123,72,58507,34651,43172,17146,600,1013,2218,2863,2416,64,29335,24010,264,460,15110,384,6255,926,64,17718,24420,384,67955,1952,383,13,468,8985,2628,72,458,19934,67886,384,384,4812,19496,16720,311,67886,6212,4284,600,1013,15110,14000,72,600,1013,18227,2143,902,1013,43172,17146,34651,17718,3376,7491,1013,9446,9919,16130,30,468,30014,14000,78,458,19934,67886,384,45290,435,8697,1013,645,56998,88754,29320,9446,545,902,1013,6386,2577,266,459,17718,24420,34651,358,2636,12654,5267,99082,13,2308,1013,264,4223,15025,84,600,2218,75163,16130,16377,34651,358,2636,12654,5267,99082,468,2218,64,2863,40069,14000,68,1013,312,8831,600,9446,1013,9446,459,5517,309,4284,15110,297,15025,84,600,89655,13,547,64,8985,2628,72,458,19934,297,685,384,384,67955,1952,383,297,685,384,2218,75163,16130,34651,358,2636,12654,384,384,58914,902,64,30,362,6255