"BS"," han"," CSC"," ag","ud"," map","as","id","ung","gan"," an"," mga"," ded","ik","ado"," nga"," mga"," emple","y","ado"," han"," g","oby","erno"," nga"," nag","p","ah","in","ung","od"," han"," ir","a"," mga"," kin","ab","u","hi"," ha"," pag","ser","be"," han"," nas","ud"," ng","an"," kata","wh","an",".\n","G","ink","ar","aw","at"," han"," Pang","ulo"," tik","ang"," kan"," Sal","udo"," ng","an"," Tac","bas"," an"," k","opy","a"," han"," Memor","andum"," of"," Agreement"," (","MO","A",")"," nga"," g","inp","irm","ahan"," had","ton"," Ag","osto"," ","1"," ha"," but","nga"," han"," CSC"," ng","an"," PAS","UC"," nga"," mag","tat","ag","ana"," hin"," ayuda"," pin","ans","yal"," ha"," mga"," esk","olar"," did","a"," hin"," ","110"," nga"," S","UC","s","."," Ben","ep","isy","ary","o"," h","ini"," an"," mga"," as","awa"," o"," mga"," anak"," hin"," mga"," emple","y","ado"," ha"," g","oby","erno",","," lak","ip"," na"," an"," mga"," mag","tur","ut","do"," ng","an"," mga"," kap","ul","isan",","," nga"," nam","at","ay"," samt","ang"," nag","b","ub","u","hat"," han"," ir","a"," mga"," kat","ung","d","anan","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Durante han mao nga okasyon, iginhatag han Pangulo en tseke nga nabalor hin P1 milyon tikang han President's Social Fund komo seed money han PPLBS endowment fund.\nGinkarawat an tseke ni Civil Service Commission (CSC) Chairman Ricardo Saludo ngan ni Dr. Lauro Tacbas, an presidente han Philippine Association of State Universities and Colleges (PASUC) dida hin yano nga seremonyas kakulop didto han Rizal Hall han Malacaņang.\nIdeya an PPLBS han CSC agud mapasidunggan an mga dedikado nga mga empleyado han gobyerno nga nagpahinungod han ira mga kinabuhi ha pagserbe han nasud ngan katawhan.\nGinkarawat han Pangulo tikang kan Saludo ngan Tacbas an kopya han Memorandum of Agreement (MOA) nga ginpirmahan hadton Agosto 1 ha butnga han CSC ngan PASUC nga magtatagana hin ayuda pinansyal ha mga eskolar dida hin 110 nga SUCs. Benepisyaryo hini an mga asawa o mga anak hin mga empleyado ha gobyerno, lakip na an mga magturutdo ngan mga kapulisan, nga namatay samtang nagbubuhat han ira mga katungdanan.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-wo-0117","collection":"dataset/fineweb/wo.jsonl","text":"Waaye limu lawax yi bëgg a nekk 5eelu Njiitu réewum Senegaal moom, bare nañu lool.\nBu dee ci kujje gi, mbiri Usmaan Sonko rekk a lëntagum xel yi. Wëliis njiitul Pastef li, ñeneen ñépp samp nañ seen i ndënd : Xalifa Sàll, Abdurahmaan Juuf, Ceerno Alasaan Sàll, Décce Faal, Maalig Gàkku, añs. Bu dee waa Bennoo Bokk Yaakaar moom, ci gaawug ëllëg gii la Maki Sàll war a fésal ki mu tànn.\nBiir Bennoo Bokk Yaakaar, ñu bare ñoo teg bët toogub Njiitu réew mi. Ñi ci gën a fés ñooy Aamadu Ba, Bun Abdalaa Jonn, Aali Nguy Njaay, Abdulaay Daawda Jàllo ak Maam Bóoy Jaawo. Ñii ñépp nag, bu ñu bennoowee yit, bokkuñu yaakaar. Ndax, kenn bëggul bàyyee sa moroom, ndax kenn wóoluwul sa moroom. Te sax, looloo yàggal mbir yi. Ñoom, waa BBY, amal nañuy ndaje yu bare yoy, Njiitu réew mi ci boppam moo leen tëggoon. Lépp rekk ngir diisoo ak ñoom, xirtal leen ci ñu topp ci ginnaaw kim nar a tànn. Waaye loolu de, ay gént kese lay ndiru.","token_ids":[97399,59539,4568,84,2329,706,61264,293,12173,14388,264,834,19160,220,20,68,77650,451,7754,32217,9330,365,372,5363,11183,278,296,4191,11,12455,4317,5653,84,775,337,624,59393,44473,11819,595,9631,3756,13526,11,10011,20636,3985,140293,11834,9322,312,19160,264,326,12173,94108,372,856,301,61264,13,467,12173,742,285,308,7754,275,360,23575,823,898,11,1683,109,1952,268,1683,109,963,602,61049,4317,5653,3884,600,15569,12173,303,549,1599,278,33656,328,6362,654,11,29525,324,1466,140293,21619,1704,11,23703,24859,1674,15416,276,328,6362,654,11,136562,346,17652,278,11,11326,278,343,479,6362,74,12127,11,71633,82,13,27138,44473,289,5305,7355,2152,78,425,562,74,39170,13326,277,296,4191,11,11