hasimende ebhizinisi. Ithimba lezinsizakalo eziqeqeshiwe lizosungulwa ngokuhlanganisa abaholi be-R & D, ubuchwepheshe kanye nephrojekthi yokwakha nokuhlinzeka ngezinhlelo ezahlukahlukene zokubambisana ngokwezidingo zamakhasimende. Le modeli yenzelwe ukusiza amakhasimende ukuxazulula izinkinga ezihlangabezane ne-R & D nokukhiqiza nokunikeza amakhasimende izixazululo ezenziwe ngezifiso ezifanelekela kangcono ukuthuthukiswa kwesikhathi esizayo.\nE-China (Shanghai) International Technology Fair kulo nyaka, i-TIANGEN ayivelanga nje kuphela i-high-throughput othomathikhi ye-nucleic acid extractors kanye ne-auto pipetting workstation kepha nemikhiqizo esebenza kabusha kanye nezinto zokusetshenziswa zohlolo lwe-SARS-COV2, oludonse amabhizinisi asekhaya nakwamanye amazwe e-IVD e-Fair ukuxhumana.","token_ids":[40,9282,40,5218,953,304,562,12534,146390,896,40659,6161,29413,336,6441,13326,2922,391,383,25576,595,896,88,812,24266,26771,3101,80885,140149,18635,71,76359,13221,512,12,3090,35,7777,336,30341,88935,392,2969,285,3362,3912,287,80,352,449,533,273,30252,2145,75173,457,595,372,585,4648,318,10933,24389,71,76359,13221,13,358,339,318,4645,512,89,1330,449,585,12523,384,8344,80,11001,4288,72,896,326,449,436,2185,360,9986,7777,562,12534,5205,276,10756,668,1466,14215,387,10906,609,422,11,17883,1387,86,747,16651,383,595,47981,43613,299,128049,339,72,88935,86,585,4223,79092,12534,3732,89,51970,308,136497,20822,273,385,43071,16705,3101,16705,3101,1952,1147,562,392,2969,285,3362,7777,562,896,89,6577,78,60055,585,4648,318,10933,13,1967,1614,72,379,16581,301,896,14660,355,17071,1079,585,4648,318,10933,14660,2200,1370,360,5607,22082,15724,64,43071,6996,5205,82788,2145,834,10906,609,422,79092,3101,6023,80,17071,79092,359,2970,4360,1079,585,4648,318,10933,22082,941,1370,360,8762,384,5679,8344,896,308,136497,333,15408,43071,333,2145,75173,8293,97456,85150,14660,940,940,3101,66731,29413,288,30385,66047,1531,449,75376,624,36,96788,320,2016,29953,8,7179,11785,14578,595,8762,18969,13326,11,600,9