,"-through","put"," o","th","om","ath","ik","hi"," ye","-n","ucle","ic"," acid"," extract","ors"," k","anye"," ne","-auto"," pip","etting"," workstation"," ke","pha"," nem","ik","hi","q","izo"," es","eb","enza"," kab","ush","a"," k","anye"," nez","into"," z","ok","uset","sh","enz","iswa"," z","ohl","olo"," l","we","-S","ARS","-C","OV","2",","," ol","ud","on","se"," am","abh","izin","isi"," ase","kh","aya"," nak","w","am","anye"," am","az","we"," e","-","IV","D"," e","-F","air"," uk","ux","hum","ana","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"I-TIANGEN inokuhlangenwe nakho kweminyaka engaphezu kweyishumi ekukhonzeni ibhizinisi le-IVD ngemodi yokubambisana eyingqayizivele efanelekile kumakhasimende ebhizinisi. Ithimba lezinsizakalo eziqeqeshiwe lizosungulwa ngokuhlanganisa abaholi be-R & D, ubuchwepheshe kanye nephrojekthi yokwakha nokuhlinzeka ngezinhlelo ezahlukahlukene zokubambisana ngokwezidingo zamakhasimende. Le modeli yenzelwe ukusiza amakhasimende ukuxazulula izinkinga ezihlangabezane ne-R & D nokukhiqiza nokunikeza amakhasimende izixazululo ezenziwe ngezifiso ezifanelekela kangcono ukuthuthukiswa kwesikhathi esizayo.\nE-China (Shanghai) International Technology Fair kulo nyaka, i-TIANGEN ayivelanga nje kuphela i-high-throughput othomathikhi ye-nucleic acid extractors kanye ne-auto pipetting workstation kepha nemikhiqizo esebenza kabusha kanye nezinto zokusetshenziswa zohlolo lwe-SARS-COV2, oludonse amabhizinisi asekhaya nakwamanye amazwe e-IVD e-Fair ukuxhumana.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-zu-0039","collection":"dataset/fineweb/zu.jsonl","text":"UNgubane obuye abe wuthishanhloko eBonisani Primary School kwa-G, eNtuzuma, uthe ukuhlehla kwale midlalo kubalimaze kakhulu ngoba bese zenziwe izinhlelo.\nUthe ngaphandle nje, kokuthi kuwo kufundiswa izingane ngamalungelo azo kodwa ulima enkulu indima ekufundiseni intsha emnyama ngomdlalo we-hockey.\n“Nakuba singithokozisa isibalo sentsha ensundu esijoyine i-hockey kodwa usemkhulu umsebenzi okusamele wenziwe. Empeleni nje kusabusa abamhlophe nezinye izinhlanga. NgeHuman Rights Day Hockey Festival sithola ithuba lokufundisa intsha yakithi ngalo mdlalo. Ngenxa yalo mqhudelwano kule minyaka emine edlule sikwaze ukuheha inqwaba yentsha emnyama ukujoyina lo mdlalo,” kubeka uNgubane oqale ukuzibandakanya ne-hockey ngo-1993.\nLesi sikhulu siveze nokuthi basaba ukuthi neligi ye-outdoor, okumele iqale ngo-Ephreli iphele ngoSepthemba ngeke iqale ngesikhathi ngenxa yeCoronavirus.\nUNgubane uveze ukuthi nakuba zikhona izingqinamba kulo mdlalo ezifana nobandlululo kodwa weneme ngosekuzuzwe i-INK Hockey Club eyasungulelwa ukusiza izingane zaseNanda, Ntuzuma neKwaMashu.","token_ids":[1861,70,392,2145,1508,55238,668,68,289,940,812,27829,385,9322,384,46309,285,5559,25017,6022,595,9986,12004,11,384,45,83,5197,13407,11,8620,383,575,12127,71,73216,4260,29413,1574,5099,75,12523,595,392,278,318,9827,595,21706,24338,7777,26747,293,2367,53106,8344,896,22082,20822,273,385,624,52,1782,7777,1342,3316,308,3756,11,88796,940,72,36412,1126,595,1704,1241,66731,220,4849,2145,7777,309,278,2185,20132,12370,78,65055,9986,8556,7523,134627,24338,1257,7523,26771,1704,1241,23066,72,526,15235,976,3834,3029,7777,316,8735,12523,582,2832,17860,624,2073,45,585,30312,7780,410,562,9506,10756,374,579,12523,274,805,4223,4572,1241,84,1531,3172,2253,482,600,2832,17860,65055,9986,990,24378,71,24338,4443,325,7963,8344,5394,355,373,273,37163,8344,896,13,13400,8397,72,308,3756,595,355,370,30632,668,309,71,22231,383,134103,6441,68,22082,20822,5205,64,13,451,709,33811,10507,6059,40021,17301,274,410,7924,220,3827,64,40062,1704,1241,10756,526,15235,73105,410,72,7777,12523,51360,12523,13,451,4370,9587,379,12523,71743,79741,301,86,5652,595,1111,1308,88,13326,976,482,1578,75,1111,74862,86,9827,575,12127,383,4223,304,68780,11998,379,805,4223,976,3834,3029,575,12127,4123,2210,775,51360,12523,2419,595,392,