ecked the rest of the desks.\n\nNo dramatic social post, no photograph of the person's information, no attempt to see how much else the system might reveal. You can report a problem without turning the report into another disclosure.\n\nWhat I liked was the response: “Thank you, we'll fix that now.” Nobody asked why I had noticed or suggested that looking at a public screen was suspicious.\n\nThe team later added a reminder to their setup checklist: test what the screen shows before, during and after a registration, including when someone walks away halfway through.\n\nA surprisingly large part of privacy is what remains on a screen when the task appears to be over. Good catch by the next volunteer too: the confirmation printer had a similar issue. 🖨️","token_ids":[48542,291,3267,264,9811,12221,4171,429,12590,279,3681,20141,594,3565,1393,8579,369,279,1790,1697,382,40,29454,3229,279,2872,12053,13,2379,29759,432,311,264,10108,19502,2150,323,10062,279,2732,315,279,75212,382,2753,21719,3590,1736,11,902,10295,315,279,1697,594,1995,11,902,4774,311,1490,1246,1753,770,279,1849,2578,16386,13,1446,646,1895,264,3491,2041,13047,279,1895,1119,2441,27762,382,3838,358,14903,572,279,2033,25,1036,13053,498,11,582,3278,5046,429,1431,1987,36273,4588,3170,358,1030,13677,476,11821,429,3330,518,264,584,4171,572,31196,382,785,2083,2937,3694,264,26443,311,862,6505,52227,25,1273,1128,279,4171,4933,1573,11,2337,323,1283,264,12221,11,2670,979,4325,22420,3123,41103,1526,382,32,28194,3460,949,315,12339,374,1128,8457,389,264,4171,979,279,3383,7951,311,387,916,13,7684,2287,553,279,1790,25067,2238,25,279,19502,22323,1030,264,4428,4265,13,11157,244,101,30423],"tokens":["Walk","ed","Ġpast","Ġa","Ġconference","Ġregistration","Ġscreen","Ġthat","Ġdisplayed","Ġthe","Ġprevious","Ġvisitor","'s","Ġdetails","Ġwhile","Ġwaiting","Ġfor","Ġthe","Ġnext","Ġperson",".ĊĊ","I","Ġquietly","Ġtold","Ġthe","Ġorgan","iser",".","ĠThey","Ġswitched","Ġit","Ġto","Ġa","Ġblank","Ġconfirmation","Ġpage","Ġand","Ġchecked","Ġthe",