-hand jacket with a spectacular repair inside the lining. Tiny, even stitches in three different colours. Whoever did it clearly wanted the repair to last, but also wanted the next person to enjoy finding it.\n\nI was going to replace the lining. Now I'm making a little patch beside the old one and leaving that work visible. An accidental collaboration across an unknown number of years. 🧵\n\nReply: Could you post a close-up without the shop label? I'd love to see the stitch pattern.\n\nDone, in the second image. Description: parallel rows of blue stitches around a small brown patch, with one yellow thread tying off the corner. My contribution is the less elegant green square below it.\n\nPlease don't be intimidated by the neatness of the original. The jacket was wearable with the hole; it is wearable with my wobbly repair. Clothes aren't an exam. I'm mostly delighted to have found something useful that also contains a small mystery.\n\n#VisibleMending #SecondHand","token_ids":[33,2450,264,2086,24340,26127,448,264,27616,12727,4766,279,35196,13,47672,11,1496,61502,304,2326,2155,26057,13,89549,1521,432,9352,4829,279,12727,311,1537,11,714,1083,4829,279,1790,1697,311,4669,9268,432,382,40,572,2087,311,8289,279,35196,13,4695,358,2776,3259,264,2632,10895,29279,279,2310,825,323,9376,429,975,9430,13,1527,48608,19992,3941,458,9783,1372,315,1635,13,11157,100,113,271,20795,25,16488,498,1736,264,3265,5239,2041,279,8060,2383,30,358,4172,2948,311,1490,279,32707,5383,382,17429,11,304,279,2086,2168,13,7662,25,15267,6978,315,6303,61502,2163,264,2613,13867,10895,11,448,825,13744,4516,61608,1007,279,9128,13,3017,18496,374,279,2686,25697,6176,9331,3685,432,382,5501,1513,944,387,83368,553,279,28385,2090,315,279,4024,13,576,26127,572,76631,448,279,14169,26,432,374,76631,448,847,289,20373,398,12727,13,75916,7629,944,458,7006,13,358,2776,10003,33808,311,614,1730,2494,5390,429,1083,5610,264,2613,22472,382,2,5715,44,2459,671,15654,2314],"tokens":["B","ought","Ġa","Ġsecond","-hand","Ġjacket","Ġ